# Git never converts a byte of this repository.
#
# A pinned version's fingerprint (_registry.toml [fingerprints], design section 9.2) is a
# SHA-256 over the exact bytes of its files, so a checkout, a ZIP export or a clone with any
# core.autocrlf setting must give the same bytes. The launchers (*.cmd) are stored with CRLF
# line endings and everything else with LF, exactly as the registry tool writes them.
* -text
